    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bridge-Building Puzzle Simulation with an Unusual Twist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to construct a bridge that allows friendly trucks to pass while ensuring enemy trucks fall into the water.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only bridge-building game where you must design a bridge that helps friendly trucks while trapping enemy trucks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deepest and most challenging levels among all competitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless mode where your budget depends on the money saved from all previous levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The easiest and most intuitive controls compared to other games.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bridge-Building Puzzle Simulation with an Unusual Twist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to construct a bridge that allows friendly trucks to pass while ensuring enemy trucks fall into the water.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only bridge-building game where you must design a bridge that helps friendly trucks while trapping enemy trucks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deepest and most challenging levels among all competitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless mode where your budget depends on the money saved from all previous levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The easiest and most intuitive controls compared to other games.</p></li></ul>",
